stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Ordered
  Ordered --> Collected: phlebotomy / walk-in
  Collected --> Received: at processing hub (barcode scan)
  Received --> InProcess: on analyzer / bench
  InProcess --> ResultEntered: HL7 / manual
  ResultEntered --> Validated: tech + pathologist sign-off
  Validated --> Reported: PDF signed + delivered
  Reported --> [*]
  Collected --> Rejected: reason code (hemolysis, label, volume)
  Received --> Rejected
  InProcess --> Rejected
  Rejected --> Recollect: re-collection task
  Recollect --> Collected
  note right of InProcess
    TAT clock runs from Ordered;
    breach alerts surface on MIS
  end note
